    <meta name="description" content="A Laravel API that aggregates news from multiple providers into one feed.">
    <title>Signal · News Aggregator API</title>
    <style>
        :root { --ink:#17232b; --muted:#63717a; --cream:#f6f2ee; --peach:#ffb393; --coral:#f5654d; --navy:#14354a; --line:#dce4e6; } *{box-sizing:border-box} html{scroll-behavior:smooth} body{margin:0;color:var(--ink);background:#fff;font:16px/1.6 ui-sans-serif,system-ui,-apple-system,"Segoe UI",sans-serif} a{color:inherit}.skip-link{position:absolute;left:-999px;top:1rem;padding:.65rem 1rem;background:var(--ink);color:#fff;border-radius:999px}.skip-link:focus{left:1rem;z-index:2}.container{width:min(1120px,calc(100% - 40px));margin:auto}header{padding:24px 0;display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center;gap:24px}.brand{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:12px;text-decoration:none;font-weight:800;letter-spacing:-.03em}.brand-mark{display:grid;place-items:center;width:42px;height:42px;border-radius:14px;color:#fff;background:linear-gradient(145deg,var(--navy),#4d8c99);box-shadow:0 10px 24px #14354a40}nav{display:flex;gap:20px;color:var(--muted);font-size:.92rem}nav a{text-decoration:none}nav a:hover{color:var(--coral)}.hero{padding:72px 0 88px;background:linear-gradient(145deg,#fff 10%,var(--cream) 100%)}.hero-grid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1.12fr .88fr;gap:64px;align-items:center}.eyebrow{color:var(--coral);font-size:.78rem;font-weight:800;letter-spacing:.14em;text-transform:uppercase}h1,h2{margin:0;line-height:1.08;letter-spacing:-.055em}h1{max-width:680px;margin-top:14px;font-size:clamp(2.8rem,7vw,5.7rem)}.lede{max-width:560px;margin:24px 0 32px;color:var(--muted);font-size:1.15rem}.actions{display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:12px}.button{display:inline-flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;min-height:48px;padding:0 22px;border-radius:999px;font-weight:750;text-decoration:none}.button-primary{color:#fff;background:var(--coral);box-shadow:0 12px 25px #f5654d40}.button-secondary{border:1px solid var(--ink)}.signal-card{padding:28px;border-radius:28px;color:#fff;background:var(--navy);box-shadow:0 24px 55px #14354a30}.signal-top{display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center;color:#c8dce1;font-size:.85rem}.signal-dot{width:10px;height:10px;border-radius:50%;background:var(--peach);box-shadow:0 0 0 7px #ffb39322}.signal-card h2{margin:46px 0 8px;font-size:2rem}.signal-card p{margin:0;color:#c8dce1}.signal-line{height:1px;margin:28px 0 18px;background:#ffffff38}.source-list{display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:8px}.source{padding:7px 11px;border:1px solid #ffffff35;border-radius:999px;color:#d9edf1;font-size:.78rem}section{padding:88px 0}.section-intro{max-width:590px;margin-bottom:34px}h2{font-size:clamp(2rem,4vw,3.2rem)}.section-intro p{color:var(--muted)}.cards{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(3,1fr);gap:16px}.card{padding:25px;border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:20px;background:#fff}.card:hover{border-color:var(--peach);box-shadow:0 14px 35px #17232b12}.card-number{color:var(--coral);font-weight:800}.card h3{margin:18px 0 8px;font-size:1.1rem}.card p{margin:0;color:var(--muted);font-size:.94rem}.docs{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr;gap:28px;align-items:center;padding:32px;border-radius:24px;background:var(--cream)}.docs p{color:var(--muted)}.endpoint{display:grid;gap:9px;margin-top:22px;padding:18px;border-radius:16px;background:#fff;border:1px solid var(--line);font: .85rem ui-monospace,SFMono-Regular,Menlo,monospace}.method{color:var(--coral);font-weight:800}footer{padding:30px 0;border-top:1px solid var(--line);color:var(--muted);font-size:.9rem}:focus-visible{outline:3px solid var(--coral);outline-offset:4px}@media(max-width:760px){.container{width:min(100% - 28px,560px)}header{align-items:flex-start}nav{gap:12px}.hero{padding:48px 0 60px}.hero-grid,.docs{grid-template-columns:1fr;gap:36px}.cards{grid-template-columns:1fr}section{padding:60px 0}h1{font-size:clamp(2.7rem,15vw,4.6rem)}}
    </style>
</head>
<body>
<a class="skip-link" href="#main-content">Skip to content</a>
<header class="container" aria-label="Primary navigation"><a class="brand" href="{{ url('/') }}"><span class="brand-mark" aria-hidden="true">✦</span><span>Signal API</span></a><nav><a href="#pipeline">Pipeline</a><a href="{{ url('/docs/index.html') }}">API docs</a></nav></header>
<main id="main-content">
    <section class="hero"><div class="container hero-grid"><div><div class="eyebrow">Laravel · Scribe · Multi-source</div><h1>One feed for the stories worth following.</h1><p class="lede">Signal aggregates articles from trusted providers, normalises the response, and delivers a focused news feed for every authenticated user.</p><div class="actions"><a class="button button-primary" href="{{ url('/docs/index.html') }}">Read the API docs <span aria-hidden="true">&nbsp;→</span></a><a class="button button-secondary" href="#pipeline">See the pipeline</a></div></div><aside class="signal-card" aria-label="News source status"><div class="signal-top"><span>AGGREGATION STATUS</span><span class="signal-dot" aria-label="Ready"></span></div><h2>Many signals. One interface.</h2><p>Provider-specific complexity stays behind a clean article resource.</p><div class="signal-line"></div><div class="source-list"><span class="source">The New York Times</span><span class="source">TheNewsAPI</span><span class="source">NewsAPI</span></div></aside></div></section>
    <section id="pipeline"><div class="container"><div class="section-intro"><div class="eyebrow">A deeper module</div><h2>Designed for readers, friendly to clients.</h2><p>Scheduled jobs handle collection while the API keeps authentication, preferences, and article retrieval easy to discover.</p></div><div class="cards"><article class="card"><span class="card-number">01</span><h3>Collect</h3><p>Fetch articles from configured providers on a schedule, keeping external adapters out of client code.</p></article><article class="card"><span class="card-number">02</span><h3>Normalise</h3><p>Expose a consistent article resource even when upstream providers shape their data differently.</p></article><article class="card"><span class="card-number">03</span><h3>Personalise</h3><p>Use preferences and an authenticated feed to return stories that match each user’s interests.</p></article></div></div></section>
    <section><div class="container docs"><div><div class="eyebrow">Built for handoff</div><h2>Start with the contract.</h2><p>Interactive Scribe documentation includes request examples, authentication details, and an OpenAPI spec for client generation.</p><a class="button button-primary" href="{{ url('/docs/index.html') }}">Open interactive docs</a></div><div><div class="endpoint"><span><span class="method">POST</span> /api/v1/login</span><span><span class="method">GET</span> /api/v1/articles</span><span><span class="method">GET</span> /api/v1/user/news-feed</span></div></div></div></section>
</main>
<footer><div class="container">Signal API · Laravel {{ Illuminate\Foundation\Application::VERSION }} · <a href="{{ url('/docs/index.html') }}">Scribe documentation</a></div></footer>
